===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The process by which something or someone (usually a word) is made more [[English#Adjective|English]]. Usually applied to [[language]] or [[culture]].
#: ''The name Dublin, the capital of Ireland, is an '''anglicisation''' of the gaelic name dubh linn''

